# The extras: packages that are not on the ISO but an install can add
# from our signed repo when it has internet (docs/packages.md, "Extras").
# The installer's Extras page (installer/calamares/common/modules/
# netinstall.conf) offers them, installer/jobs/extras.sh installs them,
# and /usr/lib/invictus/pending-extras (scripts/invictus-extras.sh)
# finishes the job on the first start with internet. Only names listed
# here are ever installed that way. tests/iso/calamares.py checks that
# the page and this list agree.
#
# package               how it is chosen
invictus-gaming         page
invictus-dev            page
invictus-office         page
noto-fonts-cjk          page
linux-firmware-nvidia   auto: added when the machine has an NVIDIA graphics card
